# Garden document migrations

Read [the data-format-migration skill](../skills/data-format-migration/SKILL.md)
before changing persisted fields. Keep file compatibility at the frontend file import
entry point. Add an Ecto data migration only when the stored backend format changes.
Keep compatibility limited to the split-file transform. Preserve `syncRevision` during backfills.
